The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-28f340c7ecb9844bb6c4ba41d078de9221b05038 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-2c50bf27ae94709c0f7f2d3d1863c94ff23ee686 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].